WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Okay, I think so too

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,640
The gang of robbers only robbed some residents

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,160
The ones that didn’t succeed were the most dangerous.

4
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,800
Yes, use this electric baton for self-defense

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,860
This current is a bit small

6
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,210
It can still be changed

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,490
Then I'll give you all the electric batons

8
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:17,880
Waiting for your good news

9
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,800
Consider the back

10
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,600
Maybe you need to get closer to your own people

11
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,360
Still need key food

12
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,720
Try planting these grains and corn kernels

13
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:30,310
If you can germinate, you can save seeds.

14
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,550
These electric batons have been adjusted

15
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:32,510
Jumped to maximum power

16
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:33,510
Remember not to touch the metal head

17
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:35,750
Don’t accidentally injure yourself while it’s on. What’s the effect?

18
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:37,670
A normal adult would hardly be able to stand up after being hit.

19
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:46,500
Run so fast

20
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,620
Reinforced iron gate

21
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,380
Plus the safety door handle given by Han Lu

22
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,020
Add this unmovable stone

23
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,100
It should be safe for now

24
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,540
Might need to fight tonight

25
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,100
Be sure to eat well to maintain your strength
